    <briefdescription>
<para>A proxy from a <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacellvm_1adce09a5a0de0e3177eb00e932734af2f" kindref="member">FunctionAnalysisManager</ref></computeroutput> to an <computeroutput>SCC</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When a module pass runs and triggers invalidation, both the CGSCC and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function" kindref="compound">Function</ref> analysis manager proxies on the module get an invalidation event. We don&apos;t want to fully duplicate responsibility for most of the invalidation logic. Instead, this layer is only responsible for SCC-local invalidation events. We work with the module&apos;s <ref refid="namespacellvm_1adce09a5a0de0e3177eb00e932734af2f" kindref="member">FunctionAnalysisManager</ref> to invalidate function analyses. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
